<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῐθαρ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιῶ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Antiph.
			141
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίθαρις</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play the cithara</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρμιγγι . . ἱμερόεν κιθάριζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.570
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				202
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύρῃ δ᾽ ἐρατὸν κιθαρίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπει ἄντα τῶ σιδάρω τὸ καλῶς
					κιθαρίσδεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oec.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾄδειν καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			 K.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιθαρίζειν οὐκ
			ἐπίσταμαι</span> I am not a 'high-brow', <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				989
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				959
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαῖον εἶν᾽ ἔφασκε τὸ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1357
				</span></i>
			: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνος κιθαρίζειν
			πειρώμενος</span>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνος πρὸς λύραν</span>
			 (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύρα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pseudol.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κιθαριζόμενον</span>
			<i>music composed for the cithara</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1144d
			</span></i>.</div>
